{"unit_id":"GooDAnDReaDY__dsh-session-control#card-zh","repo":"GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-session-control","commit":"5094fe0336b2434ea20fa57bdfdc1df2a53145fe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Control 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的会话管理插件：它通过替换工作区侧栏并提供配套服务，把会话整理和归档阅读集中到 DSH 界面中。主要功能包括置顶和隐藏会话、按内容搜索、查看归档转录、批量导出 Markdown，以及用标签整理会话。它还支持空会话过滤、会话大小提示和切换目录时继续使用现有会话。适合需要管理大量 DSH 会话、查找旧对话或保存转录的用户；安装后使用宿主会话与工作区能力，模型摘要交接需另行配置 provider 和 model。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:130-240","lib/index.js:464-514"]}
{"unit_id":"GooDAnDReaDY__dsh-session-control#card-en","repo":"GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-session-control","commit":"5094fe0336b2434ea20fa57bdfdc1df2a53145fe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Control adds session management to the DSH web sidebar. Pin or hide sessions, search contents, read archived transcripts, export chats as Markdown, and organize with labels. It filters blank sessions and shows size badges. Model handoff summaries need a provider and model.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:130-240","lib/index.js:464-514"]}
